    "V+IN − V−IN": "shunt voltage, ISHUNT × RSHUNT",
    "VREF": "voltage on VREF1 and VREF2 tied together; gain from the reference to the output is 1 V/V"
   },
   "note": "",
   "page": 11
  },
  {
   "name": "Output, reference pins dividing the supply",
   "expr": "VOUT = 20 × (V+IN − V−IN) + 0.5 × VS",
   "where": {
